title: Proxmox Mail Gateway: SpamAssassin Rules
agents: pmg
catalog: app/pmg
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 Monitors the update status of each SpamAssassin rule channel via
 {/nodes/{node}/spamassassin/rules}. Reports the currently installed
 rule-set version and whether an update is available; the state
 reported when an update is pending is configurable (default: WARN).

item:
 The rule channel name, e.g. {sa-update}.

discovery:
 One service per rule channel reported by the API is created.
